# Tidings of War: "Amass Goblins 1. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, amass Goblins 3 instead." Cast from the hand
# for {R} it puts one counter on a new Goblin Army token (CR 701.47a). Flashed back for {3}{R} (paid exactly: Black Lotus's
# three red and a Mox Pearl's white) it amasses 3 - not 1 and not 1+3 - onto that same Army (1 + 3 = 4 counters), and
# the card is exiled afterwards (CR 702.34a).

